164:      * The condition is actually of type {@link
165:      * ru.novosoft.uml.foundation.data_types.MBooleanExpression},
166:      * which defines both a language and a body. We are only
167:      * interested in setting the body, which is just a string.<p>
168:      *
169:      * @param condBody  The body of the condition to associate with this
170:      *                  extend relationship.
