347:     /**
348:      * Executes the removal of a listener to a class
349:      * @param listener The listener to remove
350:      * @param modelClass The class the listener does not want to listen to 
351:      * instances anymore
352:      * @param eventName The eventname the listener does not want to listen to
353:      * anymore
