1502:      *                  The keys are Strings indicating the names of events, 
1503:      *                  while the values are int[] which contain all the event
1504:      *                  types the indicated event represents. The specific int 
1505:      *                  values used can be found in {@link MElementEvent}.
1506:      */
1507:     synchronized void addSource (Class cSource, Map mpNameMap) {
1508:         definition.put (cSource, mpNameMap);
