1186:  * A map containing instances of meta-classes (modelelements) as keys and 
1187:  * EventListenerLists as values. The class is a wrapper around an underlying
1188:  * java.util.HashMap and provides some custom methods for easy access to the 
1189:  * underlying data structure.
1190:  *
1191:  * @author jaap.branderhorst@xs4all.nl
1192:  */
1193: class EventListenerHashMap {
1194: 
1195:     /**
1196:      * A null array to be shared by all empty listener lists.
1197:      */
1198:     private static final MElementListener[] NULL_ARRAY =
1199:         new MElementListener[0];
1200: 
1201:     /**
1202:      * The list of ListenerType - Listener pairs. 
